iew of all prior events.","The officer wants the Court to allow a review focused only on the final threat."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 29, lines 29-33","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/23-1239_09m1.pdf","page_label":"file page 29, lines 29-33"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 5, lines 23-9","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/23-1239_09m1.pdf","page_label":"file page 5, lines 23-9"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 53, lines 47-49","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/23-1239_09m1.pdf","page_label":"file page 53, lines 47-49"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 67, lines 45-49","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/23-1239_09m1.pdf","page_label":"file page 67, lines 45-49"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 82, lines 13-21","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/23-1239_09m1.pdf","page_label":"file page 82, lines 13-21"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 91, lines 47-31","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/23-1239_09m1.pdf","page_label":"file page 91, lines 47-31"}]},{"heading":"What each side says","paragraphs":["Barnes's side argues reasonableness requires assessing the totality of circumstances, including pre-force events.","The officer's side argues it is reasonable to use force to end an immediate threat to safety."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 29, lines 29-33","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/23-1239_09m1.pdf","page_label":"file page 29, lines 29-33"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 5, lines 23-9","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/23-1239_09m1.pdf","page_label":"file page 5, lines 23-9"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 53, lines 47-49","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/23-1239_09m1.pdf","page_label":"file page 53, lines 47-49"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 67, lines 45-49","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/23-1239_09m1.pdf","page_label":"file page 67, lines 45-49"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 82, lines 13-21","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/23-1239_09m1.pdf","page_label":"file page 82, lines 13-21"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 91, lines 47-31","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/23-1239_09m1.pdf","page_label":"file page 91, lines 47-31"}]},{"heading":"What the justices asked","paragraphs":["Justice Sotomayor asked if the analysis should include the reason for the stop or just the jump.","Justice Alito asked if a narrow holding focusing on the moment of threat would suffice."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 10, lines 55-39","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/23-1239_09m1.pdf","page_label":"file page 10, lines 55-39"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 12, lines 21-37","official_url":"https://www.supreme